<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Inmins cautions it in negotiations.</title>
<headline>Inmins cautions it in negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inmins Ltd said on Friday it was in talks, which could have a material effect on the share price's of Inmins, Winhold Ltd and Winbel Ltd.</p>
<p>Shareholders were accordingly advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
